---
# Example programs follow the project configuration, with two exceptions suited to small demos:
#
#   cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-vararg  the examples print tables with printf, which reads far
#                                      more clearly than iostream manipulators
#   bugprone-exception-escape          an exception escaping an example's main simply ends it
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-exception-escape,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-vararg
